      "content": "it's hard to explain. it's not just that i'm disappointed. it's like i've finished the game and there are no more levels. i look at tomorrow and i just see more of the same, but with nothing left to work toward. i feel like i've been running a race for a decade and i finally crossed the finish line, but now i'm just standing there in the middle of nowhere. what am i even supposed to do now?",
